{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年34歲的藝人蘇麗珊（Cecilia）自去年加盟邵氏兄弟後，演藝路重新出發，獲安排參演重頭劇《風華背後》，與蔡少芬、譚耀文、黃宗澤、蔡潔等同台飆戲，在尚未公布新工作前，她先到峇里島旅行充電。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;繼日</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T06:25:16.187993+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:01:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:18:22.942657+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:18:22.942657+00:00","content_hash":"1f279443475c63a528ac64679e19fd7c376b0a2ec6aae0d79d5c2c015f3d9aef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}